<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on German car basket.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on German car basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued five million European-style call warrants, on a German car basket comprising Bayerische Motoren-Werke AG, Daimler-Benz AG, Porsche AG, Volkswagen AG, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    42,500 DEM		PREMIUM	6.05 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.50 DEM		  GEARING	16.97 X</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   13.JUN.97		 PAYDATE	06.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  42,434 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
